#  Deployment scripts run on Linux and macOS, where a carriage return is
#  not whitespace: a CRLF checkout makes `set -euo pipefail` an invalid
#  option name and names an interpreter that does not exist.  This
#  repository is worked on under core.autocrlf=true, which would restore
#  CRLF on every checkout, so the ending is pinned here rather than left
#  to each clone.  test_every_deployment_script_is_line_ended_for_the_
#  shell_that_runs_it is the other half of this.
*.sh text eol=lf
